{'symbol': 'EL', 'date': '2022-07-11 16:00:00', 'title': 'THE ESTÉE LAUDER COMPANIES ELECTS A NEW MEMBER TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE ESTÉE LAUDER COMPANIES INC. (NYSE:EL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ANGELA WEI DONG HAS BEEN ELECTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS AND THAT SHE HAS ALSO JOINED THE COMPANY'S AUDIT COMMITTEE, IN EACH CASE EFFECTIVE AS OF JULY 11, 2022. MS. DONG IS GLOBAL VICE PRESIDENT AND GENERAL MANAGER, GREATER CHINA, OF NIKE, INC. (“NIKE”). “WE WELCOME ANGELA WEI DONG TO OUR BOARD OF DIRECTORS,” SAID WILLIAM P. LAUDER, EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN. “ANGELA'S IMPRESSIVE BACKGROUND AND EXPERIENCE WILL"}